WEBVTT

00:00:01.820 --> 00:00:08.080
Yuya defeated Strong Ishijima, so many 
applicants came to You Show School.

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:11.860
Everyone came to see Pendulum Summon!

00:00:11.860 --> 00:00:16.540
Yuya perfectly executed his Pendulum 
Summon in a duel against Yuzu!

00:00:17.460 --> 00:00:20.970
I Pendulum Summon!

00:00:21.340 --> 00:00:24.270
Well, that's what was supposed to happen...

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:32.420
It ended in failure.

00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:35.210
He was very depressed.

00:00:35.370 --> 00:00:39.170
But Yuya didn't give up!

00:00:54.770 --> 00:01:02.640
I set the Pendulum Scale with Scale 1 
Stargazer Magician and Scale 8 Timegazer Magician!

00:01:12.780 --> 00:01:17.400
Pendulum Summon!  Come out, my monsters!

00:01:20.060 --> 00:01:22.310
Performapal Whip Snake!

00:01:22.310 --> 00:01:24.850
Performapal Sword Fish!

00:01:24.850 --> 00:01:27.340
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:01:33.410 --> 00:01:36.000
Yuya!

00:01:37.370 --> 00:01:40.080
This was the 271st time!

00:01:40.080 --> 00:01:44.680
You used the man Gongenzaka 
to practice all night!

00:01:44.680 --> 00:01:47.910
How rude!

00:01:49.080 --> 00:01:51.510
I did it.

00:02:02.600 --> 00:02:04.140
Pendulum...

00:02:11.540 --> 00:02:13.010
Sakaki!

00:02:13.680 --> 00:02:15.820
What's the solution?

00:02:17.820 --> 00:02:20.400
Sakaki!  Yuya Sakaki!

00:02:20.920 --> 00:02:24.540
I use Scale 1 Stargazer Magician and...

00:02:31.570 --> 00:02:33.650
What's your excuse?

00:02:34.240 --> 00:02:37.710
Will you excuse me if I have an excuse?

00:02:38.140 --> 00:02:41.770
Of course not, stupid Yuya!

00:02:43.570 --> 00:02:49.210
Implementing mass into Solid 
Vision has created Action Duels.

00:02:49.210 --> 00:02:57.390
In duels where the field, monsters and duelists 
become one, the people are caught in a frenzy of excitement!

00:02:58.770 --> 00:03:01.390
Believe x Believe  Biri-Biri-Biri Buddies!

00:03:17.080 --> 00:03:20.170
You!  The strongest card 
isn't about winning or losing

00:03:20.500 --> 00:03:23.580
You!  At full speed  On the game

00:03:30.640 --> 00:03:32.320
Swinging ma ma ma mind

00:03:32.320 --> 00:03:36.890
The soul's pendulum  Ultimate confusion

00:03:37.450 --> 00:03:39.090
Impulse  Got it got it

00:03:39.090 --> 00:03:44.300
Tough battles  Real revolution

00:03:50.660 --> 00:03:55.110
Everybody goin'  Break through the walls!

00:03:57.280 --> 00:04:01.980
Infinite future  Get rid of indecision!

00:04:02.670 --> 00:04:05.920
Make it Make it  Be courageous (Break it now)

00:04:05.920 --> 00:04:09.320
Step ahead!  Take a step (Do it now)

00:04:09.320 --> 00:04:19.600
The fun is only getting started!  
So everyone's a Believer!!

00:04:19.920 --> 00:04:22.940
Believe x Believe  Biri-Biri-Biri Buddies!

00:04:26.920 --> 00:04:32.880
Darkville
Pendulum Summon Stolen

00:04:35.690 --> 00:04:37.270
Sheesh!

00:04:37.270 --> 00:04:43.800
You can now Pendulum Summon after training all 
night, but you're dreaming about it during class?

00:04:43.800 --> 00:04:45.230
Don't get mad.

00:04:45.230 --> 00:04:48.690
Since you hit me with perfect comic 
timing, everyone thought it was funny.

00:04:48.690 --> 00:04:50.870
That's not the issue!

00:04:51.780 --> 00:04:53.800
Yuya!

00:04:53.800 --> 00:04:55.290
Hey, everyone!

00:04:55.290 --> 00:04:57.960
I heard you were able to Pendulum Summon!

00:04:57.960 --> 00:04:59.470
Show us right away!

00:04:59.470 --> 00:05:00.630
All right!

00:05:00.630 --> 00:05:02.400
Let's go to You Show School!

00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:10.290
What?

00:05:10.290 --> 00:05:13.090
Triple bullseye for 150 points.

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:16.060
Impressive, right?

00:05:16.650 --> 00:05:18.160
Bullseye?

00:05:18.160 --> 00:05:20.920
You're Yuya Sakaki, right?

00:05:21.430 --> 00:05:23.960
I'm Shingo Sawatari from Classroom #1.

00:05:23.960 --> 00:05:25.200
Nice to meet you.

00:05:26.800 --> 00:05:32.180
I saw you on TV.  Your duel against 
Strong Ishijima was incredible!

00:05:32.670 --> 00:05:36.000
Pendulum Summon was the best!

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:39.470
What cards did you use again?

00:05:39.960 --> 00:05:42.030
You mean Pendulum Cards?

00:05:42.030 --> 00:05:42.890
That's right!

00:05:43.090 --> 00:05:50.070
I guess only the chosen one 
can use rare cards like that.

00:05:50.070 --> 00:05:51.830
Your name's Sawatari, right?

00:05:51.830 --> 00:05:54.200
Don't flatter Yuya too much.

00:05:54.200 --> 00:05:57.370
I'm not.  I truly feel that way.

00:05:57.890 --> 00:06:03.250
Yuya, you're supposed to show Pendulum 
Summon to Tatsuya and the kids at our school.

00:06:03.250 --> 00:06:05.400
Oh yeah!

00:06:05.400 --> 00:06:10.350
If you want to show Pendulum Summon, 
I have a more appropriate venue.

00:06:10.350 --> 00:06:15.320
I have LDS's center court 
reserved at 5 o'clock.

00:06:16.490 --> 00:06:18.890
LDS's center court?

00:06:18.890 --> 00:06:20.360
Reserved?

00:06:21.050 --> 00:06:28.000
I'm an excellent LDS student, and my 
dad is expected to be the next mayor.

00:06:28.000 --> 00:06:31.000
So when I asked, they 
gladly let me reserve it.

00:06:31.000 --> 00:06:33.540
LDS's center court?

00:06:33.540 --> 00:06:35.160
He'll Pendulum Summon there?

00:06:35.160 --> 00:06:37.310
Wow!  That gives me shivers!

00:06:38.830 --> 00:06:41.780
I think my school is good enough.

00:06:42.250 --> 00:06:47.490
But Yuzu, it's LDS's center court!

00:06:49.450 --> 00:06:52.360
Fine!  I'll go too.

00:06:52.360 --> 00:06:56.760
As You Show School's representative, 
I'll investigate my rival school.

00:06:56.760 --> 00:06:58.200
Hooray!

00:06:58.200 --> 00:07:00.400
I knew you'd agree.

00:07:00.400 --> 00:07:01.830
Let's go.

00:07:01.830 --> 00:07:03.380
C'mon!

00:07:04.180 --> 00:07:07.360
Wait a second, everyone!

00:07:11.090 --> 00:07:13.320
Everything's going as planned.

00:07:22.560 --> 00:07:24.980
Welcome to LDS.

00:07:42.780 --> 00:07:46.160
Leo Duel School, also known as LDS.

00:07:46.160 --> 00:07:51.160
You can tell by the name that Leo 
Corporation manages this duel school.

00:07:51.160 --> 00:07:53.990
This school is the industry leader.

00:07:53.990 --> 00:07:56.460
This facility is cutting edge.

00:07:56.850 --> 00:07:59.580
Tatsuya, you're so well-informed!

00:07:59.580 --> 00:08:02.850
Because my mom said this school was better.

00:08:02.850 --> 00:08:08.580
The best equipment, the best teachers, 
the best curriculum is our motto!

00:08:08.830 --> 00:08:13.140
You have everything that You 
Show School doesn't have.

00:08:13.140 --> 00:08:15.560
You're well-informed too.

00:08:15.560 --> 00:08:18.760
I'm sorry that my school is so shabby!

00:08:18.760 --> 00:08:20.480
Don't get mad.

00:08:20.480 --> 00:08:22.830
The best part about your 
school is that it's cheap.

00:08:23.890 --> 00:08:27.380
This place has things that we don't have.

00:08:27.380 --> 00:08:33.360
Just looking at the summoning methods, they 
have courses on Xyz Summon and Synchro Summon...

00:08:33.940 --> 00:08:36.250
They even have a course on Fusion Summon!

00:08:47.630 --> 00:08:49.070
Yuya!

00:08:49.960 --> 00:08:52.010
The center court is that way.

00:08:56.540 --> 00:09:00.000
I can't believe I'm standing 
on LDS's center court!

00:09:07.800 --> 00:09:08.630
Hey.

00:09:08.830 --> 00:09:11.380
They're also your fans.

00:09:11.830 --> 00:09:16.870
Can you show them the cards 
you use to Pendulum Summon?

00:09:18.230 --> 00:09:19.200
But...

00:09:19.200 --> 00:09:21.840
They only want to see it, okay?

00:09:22.850 --> 00:09:23.870
Okay...

00:09:26.940 --> 00:09:27.690
Here!

00:09:27.690 --> 00:09:29.090
Awesome!

00:09:29.090 --> 00:09:31.720
You use these cards to Pendulum Summon!

00:09:31.720 --> 00:09:33.620
I want them!

00:09:34.270 --> 00:09:35.850
No.

00:09:36.090 --> 00:09:39.870
They're not yours.

00:09:39.870 --> 00:09:41.270
Shucks!

00:09:41.270 --> 00:09:45.580
They're going to be added to my collection.

00:09:46.200 --> 00:09:48.360
What do you mean?

00:09:48.360 --> 00:09:51.980
I like rare, strong cards.

00:09:51.980 --> 00:09:54.970
I hate using weak cards.

00:09:55.200 --> 00:09:59.160
That's why I'm taking these.

00:10:00.760 --> 00:10:03.320
That's why you brought us here?

00:10:03.320 --> 00:10:04.850
That's not all.

00:10:04.850 --> 00:10:07.850
Since I have them now, I want to use them.

00:10:07.850 --> 00:10:10.600
Don't you also want to see Pendulum Summon?

00:10:10.600 --> 00:10:11.560
Of course!

00:10:11.560 --> 00:10:12.920
I want to see it!

00:10:12.920 --> 00:10:16.070
That's why I reserved the center court.

00:10:16.580 --> 00:10:18.400
Wait a second...

00:10:18.400 --> 00:10:19.490
C'mon now!

00:10:19.490 --> 00:10:24.230
Everyone came here because they 
want to see Pendulum Summon.

00:10:25.290 --> 00:10:26.780
Yuya!

00:10:27.670 --> 00:10:32.490
You don't want to duel me?

00:10:33.470 --> 00:10:35.290
That's enough.

00:10:35.290 --> 00:10:38.920
Your job is to hand over 
those Pendulum Cards to us.

00:10:39.850 --> 00:10:42.250
Nakajima?

00:10:42.250 --> 00:10:44.940
I have a different goal.

00:10:44.940 --> 00:10:47.740
I wanted these cards from the start.

00:10:47.740 --> 00:10:49.540
What are you thinking!

00:10:49.540 --> 00:10:50.630
Don't you dare-

00:10:50.630 --> 00:10:52.780
No, let him battle.

00:10:53.400 --> 00:10:54.230
President?

00:10:56.160 --> 00:10:58.090
Let him battle.

00:11:00.640 --> 00:11:02.440
Okay then.

00:11:05.360 --> 00:11:06.890
What are you doing?

00:11:08.140 --> 00:11:10.450
Yuya!

00:11:10.450 --> 00:11:11.560
Stop it!

00:11:11.560 --> 00:11:12.790
Let Yuzu and them go!

00:11:13.030 --> 00:11:15.230
Don't worry.

00:11:15.230 --> 00:11:18.690
They're just going to help out in our duel.

00:11:18.960 --> 00:11:20.130
In our duel?

00:11:20.660 --> 00:11:23.600
Oh, it's not fair if I do all the taking.

00:11:25.270 --> 00:11:27.740
So I'll give all those cards to you.

00:11:27.740 --> 00:11:30.670
They're garbage cards.  Perfect for you.

00:11:36.250 --> 00:11:37.850
You say they're garbage?

00:11:40.910 --> 00:11:43.180
Why are you doing this?

00:11:45.870 --> 00:11:47.620
Is this really okay?

00:11:47.620 --> 00:11:50.090
Yeah.  Let him continue.

00:11:50.690 --> 00:11:52.580
I'll choose the field.

00:11:52.580 --> 00:11:56.730
Rise into the sky with those 
weak princesses trapped inside!

00:11:56.730 --> 00:11:59.030
Action Field on!

00:12:00.050 --> 00:12:02.520
Prison Tower of Darkville!

00:12:22.890 --> 00:12:23.860
Everyone!

00:12:27.330 --> 00:12:33.320
A princess must be imprisoned in a tower.

00:12:38.180 --> 00:12:39.360
Everyone!

00:12:39.360 --> 00:12:41.940
Yuya!

00:12:41.940 --> 00:12:44.140
Yuzu!

00:12:45.090 --> 00:12:47.320
What's going on?

00:12:47.320 --> 00:12:51.920
Solid Vision has materialized, 
so we're also affected.

00:12:51.920 --> 00:12:54.470
It's too realistic!

00:12:59.250 --> 00:13:00.190
Everyone!

00:13:00.430 --> 00:13:04.000
If you want to save them, duel me.

00:13:04.830 --> 00:13:06.160
Yuya?

00:13:06.160 --> 00:13:07.630
Sawatari...

00:13:30.270 --> 00:13:33.090
Looks like you finally made your decision.

00:13:33.090 --> 00:13:34.160
In that case...

00:13:34.390 --> 00:13:36.400
Let's go!

00:13:36.830 --> 00:13:39.770
The duelists meet at the battlefield!

00:13:39.770 --> 00:13:43.270
Along with their monsters, they'll kick 
the ground and fly through the sky...

00:13:43.270 --> 00:13:45.940
...to move around the field!

00:13:45.940 --> 00:13:49.520
Witness dueling's greatest evolution!

00:13:49.920 --> 00:13:52.240
Action!

00:13:52.240 --> 00:13:53.180
Duel!

00:14:00.490 --> 00:14:02.540
Let's go!

00:14:02.540 --> 00:14:05.460
The duelists meet at the battlefield!

00:14:05.460 --> 00:14:08.960
Along with their monsters, they'll kick 
the ground and fly through the sky...

00:14:08.960 --> 00:14:11.460
...to move around the field!

00:14:11.630 --> 00:14:15.200
Witness dueling's greatest evolution!

00:14:15.690 --> 00:14:17.940
Action!

00:14:17.940 --> 00:14:18.980
Duel!

00:14:25.340 --> 00:14:27.010
I'll go first!

00:14:33.600 --> 00:14:36.760
I summon Performapal Whip Snake!

00:14:41.980 --> 00:14:44.180
Let's go, Whip Snake!

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:53.380
I end my turn!

00:14:55.070 --> 00:14:57.540
My turn!  I draw!

00:15:03.550 --> 00:15:04.630
I-

00:15:04.630 --> 00:15:05.400
Not yet.

00:15:09.690 --> 00:15:10.890
Who is this?

00:15:10.890 --> 00:15:12.690
I'm in the middle of something good!

00:15:12.920 --> 00:15:15.270
I told you not yet.

00:15:17.160 --> 00:15:21.340
I shouldn't be getting so worked up.

00:15:21.340 --> 00:15:22.960
Fine.

00:15:23.300 --> 00:15:26.270
I summon Lightning Hoverboard!

00:15:40.430 --> 00:15:42.830
Yuya, you're so agitated.

00:15:42.830 --> 00:15:46.130
But that's just as I planned.

00:15:59.800 --> 00:16:01.510
There's an Action Card!

00:16:05.760 --> 00:16:07.160
A trap?

00:16:07.160 --> 00:16:10.380
It's the Action Trap Break Shot.

00:16:23.960 --> 00:16:25.430
Whip Snake!

00:16:25.430 --> 00:16:30.320
Break Shot lowers one monster's 
attack points by 900.

00:16:33.780 --> 00:16:35.450
You're so dumb.

00:16:35.450 --> 00:16:39.030
Not all Action Cards have positive effects.

00:16:39.030 --> 00:16:41.350
Some of them are trap cards.

00:16:42.030 --> 00:16:43.360
No way...

00:16:43.360 --> 00:16:48.890
You're supposed to save your friends, but 
you're putting them in a bigger pinch.

00:16:56.450 --> 00:16:58.230
I can't take it anymore!

00:16:59.800 --> 00:17:02.200
I'm falling!

00:17:02.200 --> 00:17:03.090
Futoshi!

00:17:06.850 --> 00:17:09.090
Save me!

00:17:09.090 --> 00:17:11.010
Hang in there, Futoshi!

00:17:11.010 --> 00:17:12.230
Yuzu!

00:17:12.230 --> 00:17:13.270
Futoshi!

00:17:14.600 --> 00:17:15.810
Everyone!

00:17:15.810 --> 00:17:17.090
Here I go.

00:17:17.580 --> 00:17:18.690
Let's battle!

00:17:18.690 --> 00:17:22.340
Lightning Hoverboard attacks Whip Snake!

00:17:23.120 --> 00:17:25.000
Lightning Darts!

00:17:26.460 --> 00:17:27.890
Can I do something?

00:17:28.760 --> 00:17:30.630
I'll use that Action Card!

00:17:31.960 --> 00:17:33.670
Another trap?

00:17:33.890 --> 00:17:35.760
Too bad!

00:17:35.760 --> 00:17:38.140
The Action Trap Jump Shot!

00:17:40.040 --> 00:17:43.960
Your monster loses 400 attack points.

00:17:43.960 --> 00:17:45.510
Whip Snake is destroyed!

00:17:48.250 --> 00:17:52.450
You'll get hurt if you don't pay attention.

00:18:16.290 --> 00:18:17.780
I end my turn.

00:18:17.780 --> 00:18:21.800
But is it also the end for the tower?

00:18:26.270 --> 00:18:27.290
Everyone!

00:18:32.630 --> 00:18:34.690
You'll be fine, Futoshi!

00:18:34.690 --> 00:18:37.000
Yuzu!

00:18:37.000 --> 00:18:40.650
I don't want to fall!

00:18:40.650 --> 00:18:41.670
Futoshi!

00:18:41.670 --> 00:18:43.720
Boys don't cry!

00:18:43.720 --> 00:18:45.380
That's right, Futoshi!

00:18:45.380 --> 00:18:46.400
That's right!

00:18:46.400 --> 00:18:49.780
Yuya doesn't cry, so I won't cry either!

00:18:49.780 --> 00:18:51.480
I'll never cry!

00:18:52.090 --> 00:18:53.520
I have to save everyone!

00:18:53.520 --> 00:18:56.320
That's the spirit, Yuya.

00:18:56.780 --> 00:19:00.430
If it's over already, you'll 
disappoint the spectators.

00:19:01.120 --> 00:19:03.120
My turn!  I draw!

00:19:04.230 --> 00:19:09.230
Since I can't save them by land, I 
summon Performapal Skeeter Skimmer!

00:19:13.030 --> 00:19:15.200
Everyone, just wait!

00:19:15.490 --> 00:19:18.230
Yuya has 3000 life points left.

00:19:18.230 --> 00:19:23.450
When I finish him, I'll make sure 
he has exactly 0 life points.

00:19:23.450 --> 00:19:25.850
Just as I planned.

00:19:26.520 --> 00:19:29.110
My turn!  I draw!

00:19:31.150 --> 00:19:33.360
You drew a good card.

00:19:35.270 --> 00:19:36.920
I see what you mean.

00:19:37.740 --> 00:19:44.760
I tribute Level 4 Lightning Hoverboard 
to activate the spell card Tribute Trade!

00:19:44.760 --> 00:19:50.780
I add a monster to my hand that's 1 Level 
higher than the monster I tributed.

00:19:51.890 --> 00:19:56.230
I add Level 5 Stargazer Magician to my hand.

00:19:56.960 --> 00:19:58.680
Stargazer Magician?

00:19:58.850 --> 00:19:59.960
Yes.

00:19:59.960 --> 00:20:02.410
It's one of my Pendulum Cards.

00:20:02.630 --> 00:20:05.890
But you can't do anything 
with only one Pendulum Card!

00:20:07.870 --> 00:20:11.620
Didn't I tell you I was the chosen one?

00:20:12.740 --> 00:20:13.590
It can't be...

00:20:14.630 --> 00:20:17.560
It definitely can.

00:20:17.940 --> 00:20:22.770
I had Timegazer Magician 
in my hand from the start.

00:20:24.400 --> 00:20:30.360
Super rare individuals like me 
should use super rare cards.

00:20:32.920 --> 00:20:35.780
The cards chose me!

00:20:39.180 --> 00:20:41.490
Set the Pendulum Cards.

00:20:43.540 --> 00:20:45.160
Set them!

00:20:45.830 --> 00:20:48.760
Scale 1 Stargazer Magician...

00:20:50.140 --> 00:20:53.690
Scale 1 Stargazer Magician...

00:20:53.690 --> 00:20:56.800
No way...  Someone other than me can do it?

00:20:56.800 --> 00:21:00.170
And Scale 8 Timegazer Magician!

00:21:00.340 --> 00:21:02.760
And Scale 8 Timegazer Magician!

00:21:02.760 --> 00:21:05.200
Set the Pendulum Scale!

00:21:19.030 --> 00:21:20.690
Pendulum Summon!

00:21:24.430 --> 00:21:27.430
Level 5 Power Dart Striker!

00:21:28.140 --> 00:21:31.270
Level 6 Rocket Dart Striker!

00:21:32.430 --> 00:21:38.490
And finally, Level 7 Ultimate Dart Striker!

00:21:42.110 --> 00:21:46.020
Awesome!  Very awesome!

00:21:46.020 --> 00:21:50.070
Pendulum Summon is the best!

00:21:51.940 --> 00:21:54.960
This must be a joke.

00:21:56.200 --> 00:21:57.430
Yuya...

00:22:04.740 --> 00:22:05.980
Good.

00:22:13.330 --> 00:22:18.810
Catch the dream dancing in my heart
Release my falling tears

00:22:19.030 --> 00:22:28.290
I'll step out on to my first field
To meet my miracle  Fabulous One Step

00:22:35.180 --> 00:22:40.300
I realized that strength can't be given

00:22:40.560 --> 00:22:45.540
It's something I have to grab myself

00:22:45.830 --> 00:22:50.980
In that case, I have to keep moving
I can't stay still

00:22:51.230 --> 00:22:56.240
Even if walls and headwinds block my way

00:22:56.440 --> 00:23:01.840
I'll draw my trump card called 
"courage" to take a step forward

00:23:01.840 --> 00:23:06.260
I believe in my story of victory

00:23:06.550 --> 00:23:12.230
Everyone during battle is My Way
Duelists are being tested

00:23:12.230 --> 00:23:17.640
When times are tough, that's when you 
Smile, Jump, Fight & Step Up!

00:23:17.640 --> 00:23:22.940
Your smile is your Energy
Kick away your feelings of running away

00:23:22.940 --> 00:23:32.280
Jump into the new field
Shiny One Step that leads to the future

00:23:33.310 --> 00:23:40.530
One step... Just one step is fine
That's your Big Chance!!

00:23:45.230 --> 00:23:49.580
No way!  Someone other than 
me can Pendulum Summon?

00:23:49.580 --> 00:23:52.950
Incredible!  Pendulum Summon is the best!

00:23:53.800 --> 00:23:55.860
It's over for me!

00:23:55.860 --> 00:23:59.290
If Yuya isn't giving up, 
we can't give up either!

00:24:01.180 --> 00:24:05.320
You can only play that garbage 
card?  I can't stop laughing!

00:24:05.320 --> 00:24:10.630
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V:
The Only Hope!!  Block Spider

00:24:10.630 --> 00:24:13.560
The fun is only getting started!
